 X("D-19","Construction","DDL rollout environment","construction_c1 DDL (8 tables) is authored and applied nowhere, while the C1 services ARE registered in Program.cs.","A) a dedicated non-production environment; B) shared dev; C) a production window","A - an approved non-production environment. The measurement must not run against shifting data.","Gates R2 construction activation and all of R7. No SQL executed in this increment.","R2, R7","Owner","R2 entry","OPEN"),
 X("D-20","Construction","M3 and M9 measurement result","The measurement script has not been run.","Measure, then decide","Run the script in the D-19 environment. Stop automatically if M3 > 0, per the existing rule.","Gates C2 scope definition.","R7","Owner","R7 entry","OPEN"),
 X("D-21","Construction","D-08 default mode per company","The default commercial policy mode per company is unconfirmed. Modes: Warning, ApprovalRequired, HardBlock.","A) Warning; B) ApprovalRequired; C) HardBlock; D) per-company explicit with no default","B - ApprovalRequired for unconfigured companies: safer than Warning, less operationally disruptive than HardBlock, and it requires explicit authority for overspend.","RECOMMENDATION ONLY - not approved. A silent default is how bootstrap-open happened.","R7","Owner","R7 entry","OPEN - recommendation recorded"),
 X("D-24","Construction","Satellite-table consolidation timing","When to consolidate construction satellite tables.","A) before C2; B) during C4; C) never","A - consolidating after features are built on the current shape is far more expensive.","Schema shape.","R7","Owner","R7 entry","OPEN"),
