 X("D-26","Construction","Legacy concurrency strategy","Five legacy base tables lack concurrency control.","A) rowversion on all five; B) optimistic checks in services; C) accept the risk","A - the C1 work already proved the pattern.","Data integrity under concurrent commercial edits.","R7","Owner","R7 entry","OPEN"),
 # ---------------- Open: platform
 X("D-23","Security","Inventory.purchase action split","One action gates a PO draft, a goods receipt (creates stock) and a PO-to-invoice conversion (accounting effect) - three impact classes, one permission code.","A) keep closed whole; B) split into three codes; C) split into two","B eventually - the single code cannot express three impacts. Kept closed whole for now, with the VOCABULARY DEFECT reason pinned by test so the decision cannot be reversed silently.","Permission vocabulary.","R6, R9","Owner","R6 entry","OPEN - closed whole for now"),
 X("D-27","Platform","AI governance","AiService and AiInsightsService exist with NO AI-specific authorization, behind a context that still has 143 unprotected actions.","A) governed dataset-only access; B) full read; C) disable until governed","A - AI reads the reporting dataset layer, never raw tables.","Gates all AI work.","R12","Owner","R12 entry","OPEN"),
 X("D-28","Platform","Search ownership","No search implementation exists; zero source files match.","A) platform-owned index; B) per-module search; C) external engine","A - one index that honours per-module authorization AT QUERY TIME, not by filtering after retrieval.","Gates search.","R12","Owner","R12 entry","OPEN"),
 X("D-29","Platform","Client portal isolation","The portal currently uses the constrained public catalog scope only.","A) extend the public scope; B) a dedicated ExternalPrincipalContext; C) a separate application","B - an external user is not an employee with fewer rights. Aligns with D-13.","Gates portals.","R11","Owner","R11 entry","OPEN"),
 X("D-30","Platform","Mobile and offline policy","No agreed offline capability or conflict policy beyond POS sync.","A) read-only offline; B) capture offline, sync online; C) full offline","B - matches the POS sync precedent without introducing offline selling.","Gates mobile.","R14","Owner","R14 entry","OPEN"),
 X("D-31","Platform","Master Data ownership","No owner for master entities shared across modules: Employee, Customer, Item, Supplier.","A) a platform-owned MDM; B) the originating module owns; C) per-entity ownership with a register","C - those four entities have genuinely different natural owners; a single MDM owner would be a fiction.","Gates Master Data work.","R6","Owner","R6 entry","OPEN"),
 X("D-37","Platform","BRAND-IMPLEMENTATION - legacy CSS migration","crossbuy-brand.css globally overrides Metronic blue with green and gold; 327 existing views render under it. D-36 makes blue canonical but changes no CSS.","A) replace the current global green override now; B) apply blue to new screens first, then migrate legacy pages through an approved visual rollout; C) support selectable themes; D) retain legacy pages until individually redesigned","B - apply CrossBusiness Blue to all NEW screens first, then migrate legacy pages through an approved visual rollout. A global override flip would restyle 327 views at once with no design review.","Do NOT modify crossbuy-brand.css, existing production UI or CLAUDE.md in this increment. Specialized operational screens (POS, KDS, hyper lane, mobile attendance, storefront) keep their domain UX.","R3+","Owner","R3 entry","OPEN"),
